One detached baseline fluid record.

getItem

Read one exact installed item/subtype record. Unknown names cause errors, not nil.

getItem(name: string) -> item: TC.ItemInfo

Parameters

name: string
Required nonempty case-sensitive internal item ID within string_bytes.

Returns

item: TC.ItemInfo
One detached baseline item record.

getLimits

Read current common limits. The result adds no feature-specific count field.

getLimits() -> limits: TC.Limits

Parameters

No parameters.

Returns

limits: TC.Limits
One independent effective common limit map.

listFluids

List every installed fluid name once in ascending bytewise order.

listFluids() -> names: (string)[]

Parameters

No parameters.

Returns

names: (string)[]
One complete dense name array, possibly empty.

listItems

List every installed item name once, sorted bytewise, including hidden items.
The result has no details, localization ordering, aliasing, fuzzy lookup or silent truncation.

listItems() -> names: (string)[]

Parameters

No parameters.

Returns

names: (string)[]
One complete dense name array. An empty array is valid. The result is never nil.]=],
