fn: TC.Callable
Function to call under ordinary-error protection.

handler: TC.Callable
Error transformer receiving one safe failure value.

... (zero or more positions): TC.GuestValue
Exact arguments forwarded only to fn.

Returns

ok: boolean
True on completion. False after ordinary failure handling.

... (zero or more positions): TC.GuestValue
Exact success tuple or exactly one transformed failure value.]=],
