TC.FluidInfo

This record gives fluid metadata, not a tank's temperature or achievable recipe/boiler states.
It preserves finite negative/equal temperature bounds and large finite gas thresholds.
The default_temperature field is also the native minimum, with no extra alias.
No item weight, stack, rocket or spoilage fields appear on this record.

Extends: TC.PrototypeInfo

default_temperature

Finite default/minimum degrees Celsius.

number

emissions_multiplier

Finite nonnegative native fuel-emissions multiplier.

number

fuel_value

Finite nonnegative joules per native fluid unit. Zero remains zero.

number

gas_temperature

Finite native gas-animation threshold in Celsius, not promised boiling point.

number

heat_capacity

Finite nonnegative joules per native fluid unit per degree Celsius.

number

max_temperature

Finite maximum degrees Celsius.

number

type

Exact fluid-namespace discriminator.

'fluid']=],
